 "status": "Active", "type": 1, "user_id": "15526265", "has_translation": true, "text": "Ritorno felicissima e rimpinzata da questi due giorni in Sicilia: potervi incontrare dal vivo, per me, è stato incredibile quanto azzannare l’iris al forno che sognavo da due anni. \nSiete stat, tutti e tutte, il dessert più bello e buono e gentile che potessi immaginare! ❤️ che felicitá! \n\nPs una foto del luk di Mago Merlino tornato da Honolulu/ Maetro Muten per non dimenticare.", "user": {"strong_id__": "15526265", "pk": "15526265", "pk_id": "15526265", "id": "15526265", "is_unpublished": false, "fbid_v2": "17841401147950242", "username": "camihawke", "full_name": "Camihawke", "is_private": false, "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_id": "3599963566846179660_15526265", "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/487361057_684224477284393_7381724342902909070_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby43MTkuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=1&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gG-om_W26ziNrgsehki0vdH6tLy2V2GtFYmRqkRn4fbJCKWpEHuspf8x7D9UVq92b4&_nc_ohc=HHEghLUzHLcQ7kNvwEy0YwI&_nc_gid=vg7GL87y0ncXA5aZ1hMnvA&edm=ALQROFkBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af_-ZknYeOFEyTWFaN9xIrqyKZCsrfHNFvao0ePV_J-7sQ&oe=6A266AEC&_nc_sid=fc8dfb"}, "is_covered": false, "private_reply_status": 0, "text_translation": "Coming back very happy and invigorated from these two days in Sicily: being able to meet you live, for me, was as incredible as baking the iris in the oven that I’ve been dreaming about for two years.\nYou were, all and all, the most beautiful and delicious and kind dessert I could imagine! ❤️ what a happy birthday!\n\nPs a picture of the Mago Merlin's luk coming back from Honolulu/ Maetro Muten so I don't forget."}, "comment_count": 82, "can_view_more_preview_comments": false, "preview_comments": [], "comment_likes_enabled": true, "shop_routing_user_id": null, "featured_products": [], "user": {"strong_id__": "15526265", "fbid_v2": "178414